{"seq":8,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"gapTypes","key":"Consensus_Gap","label_en":"Consensus (trend) gap","meaning_en":"A stored value disagrees with a newer source consensus (trend mismatch, grade demoted to legacy), or no new source exists to check the trend. The value is not deleted — why it diverged is the datum.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"abe73e6bffd292101e5d163e22c3e84ba44a1b2b7cadc8f54f8b682d2dae121c","root":"88d0e8be2068ed542c4d3002cff35464d177c0387091b6ec857f55981606b263"}
