{"seq":25,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationClasses","key":"conserved","label_en":"Conserved","meaning_en":"A conservation law exists for this quantity (mass/moiety balance), so it has an exact reference and a target error of 0. Carried as integer counts in the ledger; numerical error is eliminated by construction, not merely tracked.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"b713129a1ad97a842013038a52c9567d19be8da72475de2d5c4b3e3025eb3e7b","root":"9ce613e49ca284266cb1e2a084adea08a343d3cf82d00bacb8947c4c570b50be"}
{"seq":26,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationClasses","key":"non_conserved","label_en":"Non-conserved","meaning_en":"No conservation law exists for this quantity, so there is no exact reference. Kept as float and its error is tracked as a budget (cannot be driven to 0). It is never mixed into the conserved ledger or the stored biology constants, and is never forced into fixed-point to feign exactness.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"9ce613e49ca284266cb1e2a084adea08a343d3cf82d00bacb8947c4c570b50be","root":"5c3b11cb8eba7db2a33fb5f4c143e087a44334fbc296b618cfb4ed0776f57d4b"}
{"seq":27,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"substance_count","label_en":"Substance count","meaning_en":"A count of molecules or moieties, conserved by mass balance (sum-in = sum-out) even as reactions create and consume it.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"5c3b11cb8eba7db2a33fb5f4c143e087a44334fbc296b618cfb4ed0776f57d4b","root":"0a4cc3f0331f5325cd5ba1656b6cf7ede2baaff16d05955fec4d013a0b40f751"}
{"seq":28,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"rate_derivative","label_en":"Rate / derivative","meaning_en":"A per-unit-time change (1/s), such as a reaction rate — not a conserved substance.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"0a4cc3f0331f5325cd5ba1656b6cf7ede2baaff16d05955fec4d013a0b40f751","root":"6bd938e53526a62cea4236d99e7c6323761d44a9c246fdccd38710c0831da6b6"}
{"seq":29,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"intensive_potential","label_en":"Intensive potential","meaning_en":"A size-independent thermodynamic or environmental variable (ΔG, pH, temperature); it does not add up, so there is no balance to conserve.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"6bd938e53526a62cea4236d99e7c6323761d44a9c246fdccd38710c0831da6b6","root":"4597a7c6b6d4bcd4889eefab82a480302687ae71f31c39e2cc5d4b95b047daea"}
{"seq":30,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"derived_scaled","label_en":"Derived / scaled","meaning_en":"Derived from conserved counts by a scaling or ratio (concentration = count × cinv; a fraction). Carries a float scale and has no conservation law of its own.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"4597a7c6b6d4bcd4889eefab82a480302687ae71f31c39e2cc5d4b95b047daea","root":"6aa2a7f83599087dd93a0f75f333110e5ae3867b5d9bff80ea691876e399c866"}
{"seq":31,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"sensitivity","label_en":"Sensitivity","meaning_en":"A derivative of the dynamics (Jacobian ∂rate/∂N) — a sensitivity, not a substance, so nothing is conserved.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"6aa2a7f83599087dd93a0f75f333110e5ae3867b5d9bff80ea691876e399c866","root":"9205d6012dd32f2759e5df88a8ccf5895614776e75a39f55f31080529f336910"}
{"seq":32,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"emergent_time","label_en":"Emergent time","meaning_en":"An emergent quantity such as a first-passage event time; it has no reference answer, so its error is a budget only.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"9205d6012dd32f2759e5df88a8ccf5895614776e75a39f55f31080529f336910","root":"ebce0bf398bba3faa9d2caebf2f654ba6a3a3a18d72c1b273fb42e1d1509ae72"}
{"seq":33,"at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","register":"conservationReasons","key":"measured_parameter","label_en":"Measured parameter","meaning_en":"An empirically measured or set input (kcat, Km, Kd, half-life, a volume setting); it arrives with uncertainty and has no conservation law.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-16","prev":"ebce0bf398bba3faa9d2caebf2f654ba6a3a3a18d72c1b273fb42e1d1509ae72","root":"48c698c66eaee0763e37ab68fb83bf21603b96cc4254d05654c05d6ae0ada09b"}
{"seq":34,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"closureMethods","key":"measure","label_en":"Measured","meaning_en":"A literature value measured for this species and reaction; the firm floor of a conclusion.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"48c698c66eaee0763e37ab68fb83bf21603b96cc4254d05654c05d6ae0ada09b","root":"60049e44a828a75ebcf508d143980088dc515e3f14f6e5bcde00193f0b931632"}
