{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"closureMethods","key":"abstraction","label_en":"Abstraction (lumped)","meaning_en":"A mechanism lumped into one constant; the detail is folded and its boundary is registered as a Structural_Gap.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"d910fc390847d69fd16fa759e3fe5198e078547856de8c2fcf302426fb2ecf1a","root":"064afc709a06ed005588aa7ae068798c8f7187df52097f0f213ba5298ee7e8cb"}
