{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"closureMethods","key":"none","label_en":"No rate constant","meaning_en":"No rate constant: event-based (immediate) in the pathway rate run, switched off in the fate engine (Kinetic_Gap); timing and the link's effect cannot be stated.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"68649a3fde654c793d94faa29600b6a922fdffbb524a0044db12daf5b764107e","root":"2a7039037da62d2619c5743754390a83ce076f710cbeb4bace47c080ef91cccd"}
