{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"judgmentLevels","key":"protocol_violation","label_en":"Exploratory (protocol violated)","meaning_en":"A protocol is declared but not registered, or was edited after registration; no validation conclusion.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"2d89b7469671f7aa85f3dbec5551b3f356c5e816e9e0e5fc52e5989492a58f4b","root":"abd217215b346fdeeb1b1a02f0525271c5df292a28cb19fa45facdba119e174f"}
{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"judgmentLevels","key":"registration_unchecked","label_en":"Protocol declared (registration unchecked)","meaning_en":"The preregistration registry was not supplied, so registration could not be confirmed; not read as validation until checked.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"abd217215b346fdeeb1b1a02f0525271c5df292a28cb19fa45facdba119e174f","root":"1c38da874d1a5efcb18920e330e03200330d9efb77ec8709dbeaead52311f1e0"}
{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"judgmentLevels","key":"hypothesis_generating","label_en":"Hypothesis generating","meaning_en":"A hypothetical run without a protocol; it makes no claim of agreement with observations.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"1c38da874d1a5efcb18920e330e03200330d9efb77ec8709dbeaead52311f1e0","root":"eac8af5e6d2fd65b1b99d171971c9c24295e129ebe2e97e15666d74b90c0d356"}
{"seq":43,"at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","register":"judgmentLevels","key":"exploratory","label_en":"Exploratory (no protocol)","meaning_en":"No preregistered protocol, so no conclusion of agreement with observations.","xref":null,"since":"2026-10-23","prev":"eac8af5e6d2fd65b1b99d171971c9c24295e129ebe2e97e15666d74b90c0d356","root":"e52b1f7fff79a7a8e7f804870197ea7a3cd12d54a44671617a2429fbd0fa4b70"}
